        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJThG4sT3_hB6-RRC5Fzkp3GX6skajL2dI9E8M6w2mSXDEXJw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 weeks ago",
        "text": "Harmeet gave me such great advice on my hair, and I absolutely loved the outcome of my haircut. I left feeling really happy with how it turned out. She’s also a very warm and kind person, which made the whole experience even better. Highly recommend.",
        "time": 1769635565,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Rajwinder Kharoud (SOHI)",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110951570308913343065/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKlAHllyoG79qkgTwqea6C6ufx9-x-lGUd18ayPKwfjX1MRW10t=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "I had such a great experience with HK beauty today! They took the time to understand exactly what I wanted and gave me the perfect hair cut and hairstyle. The atmosphere was welcoming and relaxing. I left feeling so confident and refreshed, can’t wait to see them again.",
        "time": 1759878297,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Shiza H.",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102883166945670794298/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLgQ9Uli4N4kNOU8T8TDMTNQ0aDEgaXNAosMyCJ-W7274QuNw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "I recently visited HK beauty for a haircut and blowout, and I couldn’t be more impressed! From the moment I walked in, the staff made me feel so welcome and comfortable. The salon has such a cozy and clean vibe, making it a relaxing place to spend some time.\nMy stylist was absolutely fantastic – she was super friendly and gave me great advice on what style would suit me best. I felt like she really listened to what I wanted and made sure to deliver exactly that. The haircut turned out perfect, and the blowout left my hair looking voluminous and shiny – it lasted for days, which is a huge win!\nI highly recommend this salon if you’re looking for quality service and a warm, inviting atmosphere. I’ll definitely be coming back!",
        "time": 1766332804,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Christine Clogg",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108670508093305833432/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJKsc2zCd3FeUbZC5Sc3kGqfxgg5g5YjMvCS4-dU2g_KmxutS8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Was hopeful to try somewhere new and closer to home. Wildly disappointed with this result. My left eyebrow was trimmed in one spot way too short! (right beside my nose) while no other part of my eyebrow was trimmed.\nI didn’t analyze before leaving, but now that I’m home and sitting with it, just wow. They’re awful.",
        "time": 1764362618,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Hetali",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103695698525375844217/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIEDj5m-aicevbB6pSrbT0m7puLkiWWyBr4FBoc7qSK4EASew=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "I had such a great experience at HK Beauty! I went in for a haircut and blowout, and I’m honestly so happy with the result. The staff were friendly, attentive, and really listened to what I wanted. My hair looked amazing and felt so healthy after. Highly recommend!",
        "time": 1766333326,
